{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The five tires of a car (four road tires and a full-sized spare) were rotated so that each tire was used the same number of miles during the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6cb6d315c6e56c0178a6107d10db013866d48f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> miles the car traveled.  For how many miles was each tire used?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/8105874907fe796f310990bc8f5e0213c460d122.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 6000 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 7500 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 24,000 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 30,000 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 37,500$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"518\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6cb6d315c6e56c0178a6107d10db013866d48f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> miles, four tires were always used at one time, so the amount of miles the five tires were used in total is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d5b32c7a2f5e6e23db01f87c998f1b1e70735ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30,000 \\times 4=120,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"171\" height=\"16\" />. Five tires were used and each was used equally, so each tire was used for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd2a59b84bf3a9e4b4ee4c046ead1d1188a481c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120,000}{5}=\\boxed{\\text{(C)}\\ 24,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"186\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME\" title=\"1992 AJHSME\">1992 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1992\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?